{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114182336640-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114190126\"/><p>司機被發現在小巴上昏迷。(余宏基攝)</p><p>今午(14日)5時54分，葵涌石蔭路401路線專線小巴站，一名姓劉小巴司機被發現在車內昏迷。救援車接報趕至，隨即將沒有任何反應的事主送往仁濟醫院搶救，他昏迷原因待查。據了解，當時小巴正等候客人上車，期間司機被乘客發現不省人事。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.700788+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:23:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:27.410342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:27.410342+00:00","content_hash":"910245e055ea36251e21004f6c39dee1de5f9a5a05863458ec1e60b10a3583cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}